```cypher
// 添加关系的Cypher示例
MATCH (a:Content {id: "content-123"}), (b:Content {id: "content-456"})
CREATE (a)-[r:BUILDS_UPON {confidence: 0.9, manual_created: true, created_by: "user-789", created_at: datetime()}]->(b)
RETURN r
```

### 2. PostgreSQL (辅助角色)
